# Mode$ TurnFaceUp (CR 702.37e): turning the face-down Zombie Cutthroat face
# up for its morph cost (pay 5 life, a special action) triggers Bonethorn
# Valesk, which deals 1 damage to ai. The trigger's target is chosen as it
# goes on the stack, inside the special action.
startturn human
advance 3
queue targets ai
turnfaceup human 2
resolvestack
